<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Read-only analytics sign-in | W8M</title><link href="/vendor/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="/css/w8m-account.css?v=20260801-3" rel="stylesheet"></head><body class="w8m-public-account theme-internal"><main class="account-stage"><div class="container"><div class="account-card account-card-compact theme-internal"><aside class="account-context"><div class="account-context-copy"><p class="account-eyebrow">Controlled read-only account</p><h2>Marketplace analytics</h2><p>This role sees only explicitly delegated aggregate reports and cannot mutate delivery, routes, accounts, or settlement data.</p></div></aside><section class="account-form-panel"><div class="account-form-heading"><h1>Read-only analytics sign-in</h1></div>{{if .Errorstr}}<div class="account-alert">The credentials or session are invalid.</div>{{end}}<form method="post" action="/goto/analyst/e/{{.LoginName}}"><input type="hidden" name="{{.GoURIName}}" value="{{.GoURI}}"><label for="analyst-login">Username</label><input id="analyst-login" class="form-control" name="{{.Login}}" autocomplete="username" required><label for="analyst-password">Password</label><input id="analyst-password" class="form-control" name="{{.Password}}" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required><label for="analyst-totp">Authenticator or recovery code</label><input id="analyst-totp" class="form-control" name="{{.TOTP}}" autocomplete="one-time-code"><button type="submit" class="account-submit">Sign in</button></form></section></div></div></main></body></html>
